          "answer": 3,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is D (Answer Key: Topic 3, Q3). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Writing real exam compilation."
        },
        {
          "id": "satoplam-w-t03-q004",
          "skill": "Transitions",
          "domain": "Expression of Ideas",
          "focus": "Select the most logical transition word or phrase to connect ideas and establish coherent relationships between sentences",
          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 Writing · Topic 3 · Q4",
          "passageTitle": "Transitions — Q4",
          "passage": "The Cheruku rasamu mango variety is from the South Asian country of India. ______ in 2018, 18.8 million metric tons of mangoes were produced.",
