          "skill": "Transitions",
          "domain": "Expression of Ideas",
          "focus": "Select the most logical transition word or phrase to connect ideas and establish coherent relationships between sentences",
          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 Writing · Topic 3 · Q5",
          "passageTitle": "Transitions — Q5",
          "passage": "Nineteenth century Modernista architect championed nature in their designs. ______ the dramatic archway and botanical glasswork of Palau, a Modernista private home designed by Manuell Raspel, could not exactly grow in a forest. Still, one sees natural influences in Raspel's penchant for curves and plant and animal inspired flourishes.",
