          "passage": "The first documented use of the English word \"session\" is attributed to poet Geoffrey Chaucer's 1386 work \"Canterbury Prologue.\" However, Chaucer didn't write in Modern English; ______ he wrote in what we now call Middle English, which was commonly used during the period.",
