          "passage": "In 1940, scientists first isolated a sample of the steroid hormone androstenone, which they knew existed in animals–and, they assumed, only in animals ______ scientists know that androstenone can also be found in chokecherry plants (Pruntes virginiano), but this discovery didn't occur until decades later.",
