          "passage": "In his essay \"Of Coaches,\" French philosopher Michel de Montaigne explores a relatively light subject, but he expresses heavier fare in \"Of the Inconvenience of Greatness.\" Regardless of subject matter, Montaigne works to question his own perspective throughout his essay. ______ his personal motto was \"What do I know?\"",
