          "passage": "With their distinctive cone shapes and steeply sloping sides, the volcanoes Maungarei (New Zealand) and Harunasan (Japan) may look similar from afar. Tehnuka llanko and other volcanologists, ______ can tell by how each was formed that Maungarei is a cinder cone volcano, while Harunasan is a composite volcano.",
