          "passage": "One might assume that Germany's Amrumbank West offshore wind farm produces the same amount of energy as land-based wind farms of a similar size. ______ because wind speeds over open water are generally higher than those over land, Amrumbank West's turbines turn faster and produce more energy than do most land farms' turbines.",
