          "passage": "KBFT is a Native-run radio station broadcasting from the Bois Forte Band of Chippewa's lands in Minnesota. In 2004, Loris Taylor wanted to make sure that stations like KBFT continued to thrive. ______ she founded Native Public Media, a support system for Native radio stations that now includes around sixty stations.",
