          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 Writing · Topic 3 · Q38",
          "passageTitle": "Transitions — Q38",
          "passage": "Modernista architects championed nature in their designs. ______ the dramatic archways and bird-themed mosaics of Casa Lleó i Morera, a Modernista private home designed by Lluis Domènech i Montaner, couldn't exactly grow in a forest. Still, one sees natural influences in Domènech i Montaner's penchant for curves (rather than right angles) and plant- and animal-inspired flourishes.",
