          "passage": "While most animals prefer the safety of nighttime migration, many poisonous amphibians -a category that includes the Panamanian golden frog and the cane toad safely engage in migratory behavior during the day. ______ with the sun in the sky, the amphibians striking color patterns deter visually oriented daytime predators by serving as a warning of toxicity.",
